<title>INDIA: BOMBAY SHARES BUOYANT AT START, INDEX UP 1.46 PCT.</title>
<headline>BOMBAY SHARES BUOYANT AT START, INDEX UP 1.46 PCT.</headline>
<text>
<p>**  (0435 GMT) - Bombay blue chips surge in early deals</p>
<p>	  as operators build up fresh positions at start of new</p>
<p>	  account trade</p>
<p>**  Bombay share index jumps 64.30 pts, or 1.46 pct, to</p>
<p>	  4,461.84 minutes after opening</p>
<p>**  Index heavyweight BHEL spurts 5 pct, to 469.59 rupees</p>
<p>	  as stock enters no-delivery period at Bombay bourse,</p>
<p>	  traders say</p>
<p>**  National exchange index down 1.85 pts, at 1,255.10 ahead</p>
<p>	  of end-account trade</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
